ites that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/onDrop(of:delegate:)-5hwda":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/ondrop(of:delegate:)-5hwda","deprecated":true,"role":"symbol","title":"onDrop(of:delegate:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onDrop","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"delegate","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DropDelegate","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI12DropDelegateP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/onDrop(of:delegate:)-5hwda"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"title":"Interaction_PinchView","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"type":"text","text":" (Origami’s magnification\/pinch input)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drives two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" nodes that flip the shape between its base and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enlarged state; the switch state feeds a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}]}}}